{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-02-08 08:00:00', 'title': 'FDA APPROVES JUVÉDERM® VOLBELLA® XC FOR UNDEREYE HOLLOWS', 'text': 'IRVINE, CALIF., FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALLERGAN AESTHETICS, AN ABBVIE COMPANY (NYSE:\xa0ABBV), ANNOUNCES THE FDA APPROVAL OF JUVÉDERM® VOLBELLA® XC FOR IMPROVEMENT OF INFRAORBITAL HOLLOWS IN ADULTS OVER THE AGE OF 21.2 ACCORDING TO CLINICAL TRIAL DATA, 90% OF SUBJECTS REPORTED SATISFACTION THROUGH ONE YEAR AFTER TREATMENT.2 WITH THIS APPROVAL, ALLERGAN AESTHETICS CONTINUES THE EXPANSION OF ITS TREATMENT PORTFOLIO TO BETTER ADDRESS UNMET PATIENT NEEDS.'}